expression: text
---
Search public stations by name or near a place, with their current values.

Usage: hn stations [OPTIONS] [QUERY]

Arguments:
  [QUERY]  Search by name

Options:
      --near <LAT,LON>  Near a place: LAT,LON
      --radius <KM>     Radius around --near in km (up to 100) [default: 10]
  -h, --help            Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn stations berlin
  hn stations --near 52.52,13.40 --radius 5
